# Eco-Warrior (San d'Oria) with the stalagmite: Norejaie's 681 with a full bag (the Dragon Chronicles do not fit: not
# completed, the stalagmite kept, no EcoReset), then with room but the rare Dragon Chronicles already held (GM: not
# completed). The main flow takes the true side.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Norejaie/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/681
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=85.4,1.0,110.5 lvl=30
quest Sandoria.EcoWarrior accepted
keyitem IndigestedStalagmite
login
fill-inventory
trigger Norejaie                          # the stalagmite: 681
finish                                    # the bag full: not completed
free-inventory
item DragonChronicles
trigger Norejaie                          # 681 again
finish                                    # the Dragon Chronicles held (rare): not completed
